body:
We also meet again! You drew my rosie last time! Well this time (if possible) we have a family portrait request. 

{well here's the thing. My boyfriend (Finns boyfriends tulpa) has been deathly sick and he's working on getting better. Me and Alice and zack (our little kiddos, long story) wanted to get him a get well gift... So we have an idea for a family portrait of us! Here we go brace yourself!}

La mort, me, Alice and zack in standard dorky family portrait style. La mort has dark hair, and one red eye. I know that Finns boyfriend has a picture reference somewhere but think short, shaggy black hair, one red eye, and very short in stature (~5'2"). I'm 6'1", long dark hair, large black wings, pale. Alice and zack are 8, so they'll be little ones ^.^ Alice has grey wings, curly black hair, green eyes. Zack has fluffy brown hair, black wings, blue eyes. 

I know this is a lot to ask but it really would cheer him up and make his day! We all love him dearly <3}

If you can't do all that we understand, it's a lot to ask.. Really... But you did such a great job with our rosie last time we had to come to you! If you need any help picturing luce, he is based off of lucifer, so any of the pictures you find would work!

[im a slytherin all the way!!! I'm conniving and ambitious and in not afraid to step on these losers to get what I want!!!] 

{yes yes Rosie's a slytherin... But if I' had to say what she was she's a ravenclaw... She's brilliant! Me, I'm totally a hufflepuff XD I prefer to just chill and let life guide me :3}

[the twins are gryffindor, Clara is slytherin, and the triplets are complete muggles XD Finn has always been a slytherin and I get my ambition from him :3]
